.flex.flex-col.lg:flex-row.lg:pt-4
  / From lg up only, and only with more than one page. A phone reaches each
    page by a drill-down instead, see Ui::TitleBar::Component. The column
    keeps its border over the full height and the list in it sticks.
  - if items.many?
    .hidden.lg:block.mr-8.pr-5.border-r
      nav.sticky.top-6
        ul.flex.flex-col.space-y-1.text-base.font-medium.uppercase.tracking-wider
          - items.each do |item|
            li
              = link_to item[:name], item[:href], class: link_class(item), 'aria-current': ('page' if current?(item))

  .flex-1.min-w-0
    = content
